  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit and Financial Services: Shared-risk Agricultural Financing Incentive Mechanism Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of ProMIFA is to contribute to poverty reduction, sustainable
and inclusive rural economic growth, and the creation of sustainable and decent
employment in rural areas, through organized and well-functioning value chains in
Togo.
Its development objective is to facilitate sustainable access to financial and nonfinancial
services tailored to stakeholders in organized, successful value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
